    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "Five boys each have $1\\frac{1}{4}$ litres of lemonade. How many litres of lemonade do the boys have in total?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$6\\frac{1}{4}\\text{ L}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5\\times1\\frac{1}{4}&=\\frac{5}{1}\\times\\frac{5}{4}\\\\5\\times1\\frac{1}{4}&=\\frac{25}{4}\\\\5\\times1\\frac{1}{4}&=6\\frac{1}{4}\\end{align*}$$\nThe boys have $6\\frac{1}{4}$ litres in total.",
